# A 1x1 base floor tile for the mossy kit: a flat quad that samples one
# per-unit slice of the native floor's brick region, so a filler cell reads
# at the same texel density as a merged 4x4 native floor piece. Y-up, the
# bake converts to the engine's Z-up. Centred on the cell, top at y=0.
v -0.5 0 -0.5
v 0.5 0 -0.5
v 0.5 0 0.5
v -0.5 0 0.5
vt 0.230800 0.102200
vt 0.381030 0.102200
vt 0.381030 0.177300
vt 0.230800 0.177300
vn 0 1 0
g base_floor
usemtl trim sheet
f 1/1/1 2/2/1 3/3/1
f 1/1/1 3/3/1 4/4/1
